{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">CALL statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/308997","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CALL-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CALL-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"CALL-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">CALL statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CALL-statement__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Transfers control to a dispatch routine (PRODSP)\nthat then calls a C function. You write the C function using ABL\nHost Language Call (HLC) interface.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">ABL HLC consists of a\ncollection of C functions that:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">Obtain data from ABL\nshared variables and buffers</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">Set data in ABL shared variables and buffers</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">Control screen modes</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">Provide ABL-like messages in the message area at the bottom\nof the screen</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">Using HLC, you can extend ABL with your\nown C functions.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CALL-statement__syntax_GC155O2680498\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d134597e117\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CALL-statement__idGDE1Y92662394\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>CALL <var class=\"keyword varname\">routine-identifier</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> <var class=\"keyword varname\">argument</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">...</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">routine-identifier</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The name the PRODSP dispatch routine used to identify the C\nfunction to call.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">argument</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">One or more arguments that you want to pass to the C function.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CALL-statement__see-also_GC155P2680507\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d134597e184\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RUN-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RUN-statement.html\">RUN statement</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/BUFFER-TENANT-NAME-function.html\">BUFFER-TENANT-NAME function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CAN-DO-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CAN-DO-function.html\">CAN-DO function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/308997","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"CALL statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CALL-statement.html","type":"Manual"}